WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:02.785
Mastery Starter 6.0.

00:00:02.785 --> 00:00:04.800
New to Protocol Research?

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:05.860
Start here.

00:00:05.860 --> 00:00:07.947
In about ten minutes, you'll go from

00:00:07.947 --> 00:00:09.640
zero to ready for this module.

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:14.041
Before trusting a protocol with money, a professional

00:00:14.041 --> 00:00:16.568
researches it the same way every time: what

00:00:16.568 --> 00:00:18.980
it does, where its money comes from, what

00:00:18.980 --> 00:00:21.622
it depends on, whether it's solvent, what the

00:00:21.622 --> 00:00:23.575
evidence says, and how to get out.

00:00:24.875 --> 00:00:28.305
Due diligence: structured research before investing.

00:00:28.305 --> 00:00:32.190
TVL: total value deposited in a protocol.

00:00:32.190 --> 00:00:35.760
FDV: token price × maximum supply.

00:00:35.760 --> 00:00:38.542
Governance: how holders vote on changes.

00:00:38.542 --> 00:00:39.906
Thesis: what must be true

00:00:39.906 --> 00:00:41.217
for the position to work.

00:00:42.517 --> 00:00:44.132
Modules 0–5.

00:00:45.432 --> 00:00:47.700
Pick a protocol you've heard of and write

00:00:47.700 --> 00:00:49.969
one sentence for each of the six research

00:00:49.969 --> 00:00:51.967
steps, even if it's "don't know yet".

00:00:53.267 --> 00:00:56.332
Beginner: Completes the six-step loop with sources.

00:00:56.332 --> 00:00:59.522
Practitioner: Reads tokenomics and governance and

00:00:59.522 --> 00:01:01.992
writes a thesis with invalidation.

00:01:01.992 --> 00:01:04.378
Master: Spots failure patterns early and

00:01:04.378 --> 00:01:06.357
writes verdicts others can act on.

00:01:07.657 --> 00:01:11.408
You've mastered this module when your due-diligence file ends

00:01:11.408 --> 00:01:14.252
in a verdict with size, conditions and an exit.

00:01:15.552 --> 00:01:18.067
Do the checklist now, before you move on.

00:01:18.067 --> 00:01:21.615
Next up, Lesson 6.1: Protocol due diligence.
